{"toolCallId":"call_07e706b885fc43d5b62b4040311aec36","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/validation/template-compliance-contract.md:67:At every level the template also places a `measured-behavior` anchor (### Measured Behavior, no H2) right after `problem`. It has no H2, so it is not a required anchor; the `MEASURED_BEHAVIOR` rule warns when a `spec.md` stamped v2.4 or later leaves it missing or empty.\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/validation/template-compliance-contract.md:298:| 1.6.0.17 | 2026-10-26 | Templates at v2.4: dropped the effort-estimation and second rollback plan addenda, made `fix-completeness` an optional FIX ADDENDUM, noted the `measured-behavior` block |\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/validation/validation-rules.md:67:| `MEASURED_BEHAVIOR` | WARNING  | spec.md stamped v2.4+ | `measured-behavior` anchor present with the changed command's verbatim output, or an `N/A:` line with a reason |\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/validation/validation-rules.md:140:**The anchor:** `### Measured Behavior`, right after the problem section. The rule warns when that anchor is missing, and when its block holds neither a non-empty fenced command output nor an `N/A:` line with a reason.\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/validation/validation-rules.md:147:| `warn`, missing | No `measured-behavior` anchor in `spec.md` |\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/lib/validator-registry.json:243:    \"script_path\": \"rules/check-measured-behavior.sh\",\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/lib/validator-registry.json:246:    \"description\": \"Warns when a spec.md stamped from spec-core at v2.4 or later has no measured-behavior block, or a block with neither a non-empty fenced output line nor an N/A: line that gives a reason. Older stamps are not applicable. Never an error.\"\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-measured-behavior.sh:11:# Description: Warns when spec.md has no measured-behavior block, or a block that\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-measured-behavior.sh:28:measured_behavior_applicability() {\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-measured-behavior.sh:53:# Prints \"absent\", \"empty\" or \"filled\" for the measured-behavior block. A fence\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-measured-behavior.sh:57:measured_behavior_block_state() {\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-measured-behavior.sh:61:        /^[[:space:]]*<!--[[:space:]]*ANCHOR:measured-behavior[[:space:]]*-->[[:space:]]*$/ {\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-measured-behavior.sh:65:        /^[[:space:]]*<!--[[:space:]]*\\/ANCHOR:measured-behavior[[:space:]]*-->[[:space:]]*$/ {\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-measured-behavior.sh:111:    applicability=$(measured_behavior_applicability \"$spec\")\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-measured-behavior.sh:119:    state=$(measured_behavior_block_state \"$spec\")\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-measured-behavior.sh:126:            RULE_MESSAGE=\"spec.md has no measured-behavior block\"\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-measured-behavior.sh:127:            RULE_DETAILS=(\"spec.md: add the measured-behavior anchor with a ### Measured Behavior heading right after the problem anchor\")\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-measured-behavior.sh:128:            RULE_REMEDIATION=\"Run the command that shows the current behavior and paste the command and its verbatim output into a fence inside the measured-behavior block, or write an N/A: line that gives the reason.\"\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/rules/check-measured-behavior.sh:133:            RULE_DETAILS=(\"spec.md: the measured-behavior block is empty\")\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/measured-behavior-rule.vitest.ts:2:// MODULE: Measured Behavior Rule Tests\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/measured-behavior-rule.vitest.ts:17:const RULE = path.join(CLI_ROOT, 'rules', 'check-measured-behavior.sh');\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/measured-behavior-rule.vitest.ts:27:    : `<!-- ANCHOR:measured-behavior -->\\n### Measured Behavior\\n<!-- FILL: Paste the command and its verbatim output. -->\\n\\n${block}\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:measured-behavior -->\\n\\n`;\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/measured-behavior-rule.vitest.ts:50:  const folder = mkdtempSync(path.join(tmpdir(), 'measured-behavior-'));\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/measured-behavior-rule.vitest.ts:69:  it('warns when a v2.4 spec has no measured-behavior block', () => {\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/measured-behavior-rule.vitest.ts:71:    expect(result).toEqual({ status: 'warn', message: 'spec.md has no measured-behavior block' });\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/measured-behavior-rule.vitest.ts:112:    expect(row).toMatchObject({ severity: 'warn', script_path: 'rules/check-measured-behavior.sh' });\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/snapshots/scaffold-golden-snapshots.vitest.ts.snap:544:<!-- ANCHOR:measured-behavior -->\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/snapshots/scaffold-golden-snapshots.vitest.ts.snap:545:### Measured Behavior\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/snapshots/scaffold-golden-snapshots.vitest.ts.snap:550:<!-- /ANCHOR:measured-behavior -->\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/snapshots/scaffold-golden-snapshots.vitest.ts.snap:1031:<!-- ANCHOR:measured-behavior -->\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/snapshots/scaffold-golden-snapshots.vitest.ts.snap:1032:### Measured Behavior\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/snapshots/scaffold-golden-snapshots.vitest.ts.snap:1037:<!-- /ANCHOR:measured-behavior -->\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/snapshots/scaffold-golden-snapshots.vitest.ts.snap:1774:<!-- ANCHOR:measured-behavior -->\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/snapshots/scaffold-golden-snapshots.vitest.ts.snap:1775:### Measured Behavior\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/snapshots/scaffold-golden-snapshots.vitest.ts.snap:1780:<!-- /ANCHOR:measured-behavior -->\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/snapshots/scaffold-golden-snapshots.vitest.ts.snap:2710:<!-- ANCHOR:measured-behavior -->\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/snapshots/scaffold-golden-snapshots.vitest.ts.snap:2711:### Measured Behavior\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/snapshots/scaffold-golden-snapshots.vitest.ts.snap:2716:<!-- /ANCHOR:measured-behavior -->\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w776a5f2639/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"e0cebe","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
